# Database changes

Before changing entities, schema, migrations, or the database connection, read `docs/handoffs/database-schema.md`.

Preserve the `TR_*` imported report, `TS_*` editable order, and `REF_*` reference-data ownership boundary. Update migrations and the Entity Framework model together.
